{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thief stole a sacred artifact from the underground city of Lichnos, and since then, his hometown has fallen into decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On his deathbed, he hired a mercenary to return the artifact to its rightful place. What he didn't know is that this same artifact was the seal that protected Lichnos from the evil that lurked beneath...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an ancient underground city amidst a monster invasion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire new skills and tools to traverse the environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive through fast turn-based battles against monsters that overrun the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with survivors to reforge your weapons and learn new magic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find better gear to withstand hard-hitting beasts that await below</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3773120?t=1758164700","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3773120?t=1758164700","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773120/d84b31c0428826a1a2043e5fb11e7737bf771c0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758164700","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773120/d84b31c0428826a1a2043e5fb11e7737bf771c0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758164700","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thief stole a sacred artifact from the underground city of Lichnos, and since then, his hometown has fallen into decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On his deathbed, he hired a mercenary to return the artifact 